      "id": "claim_87e4830ff33144eaa30d52b0246a1fbe",
      "statement": "After authenticating an extension the relay sends a browser_presence_request; the extension replies with a browser_presence_announce payload extending BrowserPresence (browserInstanceId, label, browserName, profileName, capabilities, connectedAt, lastSeenAt). The relay upserts this into a per-scopeKey presence map, preserving connectedAt on reconnect and refreshing lastSeenAt.",
