      "id": "claim_f1da6fe8d5fc4cf59440196aa915d6e7",
      "statement": "list_tabs is forwarded to the selected extension rather than answered by the relay. The relay selects the extension via target.browserInstanceId, registers the request id as pending, and forwards the full envelope unchanged; the extension's BrijioBackgroundController detects isListTabsEnvelope, calls its tabLister.listTabs() adapter, and replies with a tab_list_response that the relay routes back via message.id.",
