    {
      "id": "claim_8c8eaa6a60904f9aa635f8a67d5b9bfe",
      "statement": "Tab targeting is explicit and per-call with no hidden selected-tab session state. The MCP client places tabId into envelope.target.tabId; the relay forwards target unchanged; the extension's extractTabId reads message.target.tabId, parses it to a number, and threads it through page-context, action, batch, navigate, and page-content handlers. When tabId is absent every function falls back to tabs.query active currentWindow. There is no select_tab session-level default.",
