    {
      "id": "claim_84e0d838cf184de7b2ac6d2dbce8cc42",
      "statement": "File uploads use a staged chunked flow: stage_file_upload_start (uploadId, file metadata, chunkSize, totalChunks), stage_file_upload_chunk (uploadId, index, dataBase64), stage_file_upload_complete (uploadId, optional sha256), then stage_file_upload_staged and stage_file_upload_ack, with stage_file_upload_error carrying a closed error-code set (invalid_file_payload, checksum_mismatch, file_too_large, invalid_file_name, invalid_file_type, upload_expired). Upload envelopes target a browserInstanceId, not a tab.",
