      "id": "claim_24355ef8f9ea456eb0c933bd42ce7e81",
      "statement": "Download and fetch status share DownloadState (in_progress, complete, interrupted); FetchResourceInfo additionally allows 'streaming'. download_status requests return a capability of 'full' or 'not_supported' (Safari reports not_supported with empty items). fetch_resource returns a stream: fetch_resource_start, zero or more fetch_resource_chunk, then fetch_resource_complete (sha256, totalBytes) or fetch_resource_error. DownloadFileRequest and FetchResourceRequest extend ApprovalMetadata (optional actionUUID/approvalRequest).",
