      "id": "claim_d520714cc5ee4ee69ca5f2583b4341b7",
      "statement": "Screenshot capture (ADR 0064) is explicit viewport-only JPEG: capture_screenshot request returns screenshot_response with ok true data (dataBase64, width, height, tabId, capturedAt) or ok false error with code in (capability_not_supported, capture_failed, no_visible_tab, timeout). The MCP tool returns MCP image content. For P3.3 only the active/visible tab is captured; the tabId input exists for forward compatibility. The capability enum value is 'screenshot'.",
