      "id": "claim_20d745edd1e042998fd708ec128b07ae",
      "statement": "The WebSocket Relay Protocol table in docs/project/CAPABILITY_MATRIX.md uses message names (extension_connected, get_status/status_response, action_result) that predate the typed protocol and do not match the code's payload type discriminants (browser_presence_*, list_browsers/browser_list, perform_action/action_result). The matrix also omits tab, upload, download/fetch, and screenshot message types. The code is authoritative for on-the-wire payload.type values; the matrix is the capability/support contract, not a wire-format reference.",
